t was drawn with  greyish white hair because white hair  has a lot of meaning in Japanese culture  and  anime as a medium in particular anime  characters with white hair often have  mystical magical or godly powers think  of Inuyasha  Tachibana Kannada from Angel Beats and  UA from Cardcaptor Sakura white hair  also symbolizes wisdom self-control  discipline purity Awakening and new  beginnings in addition we know that Goku  Super Saiyan God form has red hair which  is reminiscent of flames and Super  Saiyan blue which is the Super Saiyan  transformation combined with the Super  Saiyan God form has blue hair an  interesting scientific fact is that blue  flames are known to be hotter than red  flames so it makes sense for Super  Saiyan blue to be a higher form in this  case moreover the absolutely hottest  flames possible are known to burn a blue  white color the flame is blue around the  outer edges and white at the core  closest to the source of the flame to  continue this flame analogy I believe  that in his final form  Goku hair will move beyond blue and  become white the other characters that  have white hair and draggable super are  of course the angels the most powerful  creatures other than Zeno himself and  sama soo and fused the muscles it's  interesting to note that the masu also  has silver eyes and in his new form goku  will also have silver eyes so it would  make sense to me if the form that goku  eventually reaches beyond this one will  be one where his hair becomes white in  anime characters with white hair are  often shown as self-sufficient and as  loners as if they're above the concerns  of normal mortals think of near from  bethe node and ginkgo from Liu shishi  and this leads me to another point  discussed in our who will be the final  villain in Dragon Ball super video one  of the theories examined in that video  is that Goku could potentially become  the final villain in Dragon Ball super  but the only way that I could see  something like that 